    "preamble": "Himanshu Jeswani vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 22 April, 2025 Author: Gurpal Singh Ahluwalia Bench: G. S. Ahluwalia Neutral Citation No. 2025:Mphc-Gwl:8862 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Gwalior Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice G. S. Ahluwalia On The 22nd Of April, 2025 Miscellaneous Second Appeal No. 20 of 2025 Himanshu Jeswani Versus The State Of Madhya Pradesh Appearance: Shri Harshad Bahrani - Advocate for appellant. Shri S.S. Kushwaha - Government Advocate for State. Order",
